Package: neurodata
Type: Package
Title: Neural Dataset Encoding for Privacy-Preserving Data Sharing
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Richmond", "Kessie",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: R interface to NeuroData. Encodes a tabular dataset as a compact
    neural network (.model file) for privacy-preserving sharing. Recipients
    query the model like a data frame — no raw data ever leaves the data owner.
    Supports optional differential privacy (DP-SGD) and AES-256-GCM encryption.
    Wraps the Python neurodata package via reticulate.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    reticulate (>= 1.28)
Suggests:
    dplyr,
    tibble,
    knitr
RoxygenNote: 7.2.3
